  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T21:08:51.862Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One suggestion I would make would be to make it possible to play Vrchat without easy anticheat. So that you can then only join users who also have easy anticheat off. As a result, vr chat would not have to feel responsible if people in lobbies are crashed or otherwise without easy anticheat. For the easy anticheat people, however, there is the possibility to activate that they can also be in lobbies where people without easy anticheat are. Of course, this would mean that people with easy anticheat would not be protected if they decided to join people without easy anticheat. Nevertheless, this would then be your own fault and not that of vr chat",
